  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the reaction :<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>SO</mtext> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>aq</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </msub> <mo>+</mo> <msubsup> <mtext>Sn</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>aq</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mrow> <mn>4</mn> <mo>+</mo> </mrow> </msubsup> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi>l</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo> </mrow> </mfenced> </msub> <mo>&#8594;</mo> <msubsup> <mtext>Sn</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>aq</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mo>+</mo> </mrow> </msubsup> <mo>+</mo> <msubsup> <mtext>HSO</mtext> <mrow> <mn>4</mn> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>aq</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mo>-</mo> </msubsup> <mo>+</mo> <mn>3</mn> <msubsup> <mtext>H</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>aq</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>+</mo> </msubsup> </mrow> </math><br /><br />Which of the following statements is correct ?"
  },
